    {"op": "note", "text": "The end slides (NVDLC01Ending). At the Villa the player opens the Sierra Madre's gate to the Mojave (unlocked by MQ03 100; message box, button 1): the gate's script starts NVDLC01Ending and moves the player to the slide room. The player lands in its trigger (physics sensors stand in): with the Ending running the narrator says the intro (Elijah's version, since Dean died), Dog's, Dean's and Christine's slides and the finale; the finale's SayToDone starts the bunker transition timer, which moves the player to the bunker's end marker and stops the Ending."},
